WEBVTT

00:04.462 --> 00:05.964
[intriguing music playing]

00:08.008 --> 00:09.551
[birds chirping peacefully]

00:13.888 --> 00:16.099
- [distant alarm sounding]
- [yawning] Huh?

00:17.017 --> 00:19.394
- Hey, wait! Stop. Stop!
- [air whooshing]

00:19.477 --> 00:20.520
[screams]

00:21.646 --> 00:22.605
[Fujita grunts]

00:23.440 --> 00:24.566
[exhales slowly]

00:25.358 --> 00:27.235
I need to see Mr. En!

00:28.528 --> 00:30.530
[frantic electronic music playing]

00:42.917 --> 00:44.669
[lyrics in Japanese]

01:56.032 --> 01:57.033
THE BEGINNING

01:57.117 --> 01:57.951
[music fades]

02:02.705 --> 02:03.957
Caiman...

02:05.500 --> 02:06.918
- [knocking on door]
- Hmm?

02:07.001 --> 02:08.211
[door opens]

02:08.878 --> 02:09.838
Hey.

02:10.547 --> 02:12.257
How are you feeling this morning?

02:12.340 --> 02:14.092
- [door closes]
- Well, so-so.

02:14.175 --> 02:16.094
[Kasukabe grunting softly]

02:16.177 --> 02:19.347
Noi told us everything.
So, you're nearly dead?

02:19.430 --> 02:22.350
You know, Shin,
you don't have to be so blunt.

02:22.433 --> 02:28.022
Yeah. It's only because this smoke drip
Noi gave me I'm able to hang on.

02:30.191 --> 02:32.735
Look, I know
it's not the best time for this, but...

02:32.819 --> 02:34.237
- [clunking]
- [Nikaido gasps]

02:38.825 --> 02:39.659
MY SECRET PLAN

02:39.742 --> 02:42.745
- [man 1] Hey, boss, it's Fujita.
- [En] Enter.

02:43.329 --> 02:45.248
What happened, Fujita?

02:45.331 --> 02:46.666
[uneasy music playing]

02:46.749 --> 02:48.084
Uh, well, it's...

02:50.044 --> 02:51.254
It's Ebisu.

02:51.337 --> 02:52.755
Ebisu's dead.

02:52.839 --> 02:55.758
- [En] Hmm. And?
- [Fujita gasps indignantly]

02:56.593 --> 03:01.014
Well, um, you know, I was thinking

03:01.639 --> 03:02.849
that maybe Kikurage...

03:02.932 --> 03:03.766
[Kikurage] Hm?

03:03.850 --> 03:06.019
[Fujita] ...er... with Kikurage's Magic...

03:06.102 --> 03:07.896
IT SEEMS
THEY'RE TALKING ABOUT ME DOWNSTAIRS

03:08.479 --> 03:13.902
Fujita, Kikurage isn't my pet.
She's a proper member of the family.

03:13.985 --> 03:15.904
IS IT TIME TO EAT? GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:15.987 --> 03:16.988
Hear that?

03:17.071 --> 03:18.072
IS IT TIME TO EAT?

03:18.156 --> 03:21.910
Kikurage just repeated what I said.
As proof, I've never given her an order.

03:21.993 --> 03:24.245
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.
IS IT TIME TO EAT?

03:24.329 --> 03:26.164
I just use her nature to my advantage.

03:26.247 --> 03:28.458
Then what am I supposed to do?

03:28.541 --> 03:31.169
I need her Magic
to be able to revive Ebisu!

03:31.753 --> 03:33.630
That depends completely
on Kikurage's feelings.

03:33.713 --> 03:34.756
GIVE ME FOOD, PLEASE.

03:34.839 --> 03:35.673
And by the way,

03:36.799 --> 03:40.428
if you try to force her to use her Magic,
something terrible will happen.

03:40.511 --> 03:42.180
IS THE FOOD NOT READY?
FOOD, PLEASE.

03:42.263 --> 03:45.058
[gasps] Something terrible?

03:46.267 --> 03:48.728
IT'S ABOUT TIME FOR MY PATROL.

03:48.811 --> 03:52.190
Guess I need to use her nature
to my advantage...

03:52.774 --> 03:54.150
If I remember correctly,

03:54.234 --> 03:57.195
she feels like reviving people
when there's a corpse nearby.

03:57.278 --> 04:01.199
She was close enough to Ebisu
to sleep in her bed...

04:01.783 --> 04:03.201
LET'S START WITH THIS ROOM...

04:04.786 --> 04:05.995
ALL CLEAR.

04:07.038 --> 04:08.206
LET'S GO TO THE NEXT ROOM...

04:08.289 --> 04:09.207
[Fujita] Kikurage...

04:09.290 --> 04:10.917
HUH? WHO'S CALLING FOR ME?

04:11.000 --> 04:12.460
Come here, girl.

04:12.543 --> 04:14.462
Kikurage...

04:15.004 --> 04:16.965
TH, THAT...

04:17.048 --> 04:18.967
- [Fujita] Kikurage...
- [flies buzzing]

04:19.050 --> 04:20.969
TH, THAT SMELLS OF DEATH!

04:21.052 --> 04:23.263
[Fujita] Kikurage, wait up!

04:23.346 --> 04:24.347
[goons whispering]

04:24.931 --> 04:26.683
OH, THAT WAS VERY UNPLEASANT.

04:26.766 --> 04:27.809
[Kasukabe] But know what?

04:27.892 --> 04:29.352
- I was examining the head.
- Huh?

04:29.435 --> 04:30.395
Something's not right.

04:30.478 --> 04:31.688
WHAT ARE YOU ALL DOING?

04:31.771 --> 04:36.484
[Kasukabe] The spikes on the head
were carefully cut off. And also, look.

04:36.567 --> 04:38.361
It appears like someone dissected it.

04:38.444 --> 04:39.988
IT SMELLS A BIT OF DEATH AGAIN...

04:40.071 --> 04:40.989
[gasps]

04:41.072 --> 04:42.240
I see!

04:42.824 --> 04:44.492
It's the head from back then!

04:44.575 --> 04:47.370
Oh, that's the one I cut off, isn't it?

04:47.453 --> 04:50.665
If I recall,
I made that cut with my hammer.

04:51.332 --> 04:53.835
If that's the case,
what was it doing just lying around?

04:53.918 --> 04:55.378
MY CROTCH IS SUDDENLY ITCHY.

04:56.004 --> 05:00.133
Well, I don't know about that,
but there's something else I saw...

05:00.216 --> 05:03.177
Caiman doesn't have a lizard face anymore.

05:03.261 --> 05:04.887
- [both] Huh?
- [door crashes open]

05:04.971 --> 05:07.473
- What? Is that true?!
- Uh, what's all this?

05:07.557 --> 05:08.933
IT REEKS OF DEATH!

05:09.017 --> 05:10.893
Hey, come back!

05:11.978 --> 05:14.939
If that lizard guy's face
is back to normal, that means

05:15.523 --> 05:17.984
Ebisu must have cast her magic on him.

05:18.776 --> 05:20.236
Did you kill her?

05:20.320 --> 05:24.282
Of course not!
I just want Kikurage to revive her.

05:24.365 --> 05:27.827
Even if you do that, I wonder
how the devil tumor is in her head.

05:27.910 --> 05:30.371
- Huh?
- Fujita, have him take a look.

05:30.455 --> 05:33.124
His intentions may not be good,
but his skills are.

05:34.459 --> 05:37.003
[wailing] Her beautiful hair!

05:37.086 --> 05:39.130
Well, you're the one
who wrapped it in duct tape.

05:39.714 --> 05:42.133
[Fujita] Yeah, it looks like it's okay.

05:42.216 --> 05:47.305
Before you revive her and everything,
why don't you have Noi heal the damage?

05:47.388 --> 05:48.806
Yeah, I'll do that.

05:49.724 --> 05:51.642
I can't believe it.

05:51.726 --> 05:55.521
Everyone's acting so indifferent
about Ebisu's death.

05:55.605 --> 05:59.609
I wonder if they'd react
the same way if I died?

06:00.109 --> 06:01.110
Huh? Kikurage! Wha--

06:01.194 --> 06:02.028
EEK! YOU AGAIN?!

06:02.111 --> 06:04.989
Don't keep running away!
Isn't Ebisu your friend... Oof!

06:06.324 --> 06:08.242
What are you doing, you idiot?

06:08.326 --> 06:10.745
You almost broke my mushroom!
Are you trying to kill me?

06:10.828 --> 06:12.997
[gasps] Is that Chota?

06:13.081 --> 06:14.415
[mysterious music playing]

06:14.499 --> 06:16.959
[Chota] Sorry I didn't realize
it was you, Fujita.

06:17.043 --> 06:19.337
After all, I can't see out of this thing.

06:19.420 --> 06:20.922
Th... that must be tough.

06:21.589 --> 06:25.676
But wouldn't it be easy for you to turn
yourself back to normal with your Magic?

06:25.760 --> 06:28.805
That's true, but you know...
[giggles] ...I like this mushroom.

06:28.888 --> 06:32.225
It smells so much like En.
I love it! [giggles]

06:32.308 --> 06:34.060
Ah. Well, that's nice...

06:34.143 --> 06:35.186
[sniffing]

06:35.269 --> 06:37.563
Speaking of smells, ew, what is that?

06:37.647 --> 06:39.816
So, actually...

06:41.067 --> 06:43.319
[Chota] I see. So Ebisu is...

06:43.403 --> 06:46.155
Hang on.
I have something to bring her luck.

06:46.239 --> 06:47.949
Poor thing never had much.

06:48.032 --> 06:51.160
- Doesn't have much hair now either.
- [singsongy] Here it is!

06:51.244 --> 06:53.496
I got this from a devil a long time ago.

06:53.579 --> 06:55.248
They say that if you wear this hairpin,

06:55.331 --> 06:58.334
you can guarantee you'll always have
a big smile on your face.

06:58.418 --> 07:00.044
I'll put it on her.

07:00.545 --> 07:02.255
- Done!
- [creepy music playing]

07:02.338 --> 07:04.549
[Fujita] It suits you, Ebisu.

07:07.677 --> 07:11.139
Now, where did Kikurage run off to?

07:11.222 --> 07:12.098
Oh?

07:12.181 --> 07:13.599
It's Noi!

07:14.183 --> 07:15.852
[yelling in distance] Hey, Noi!

07:15.935 --> 07:17.437
- [dramatic music playing]
- Right.

07:17.520 --> 07:20.481
Let's see if any of you shrooms
can land a punch.

07:20.565 --> 07:21.858
[Noi grunting]

07:29.365 --> 07:33.494
[yelling]

07:34.036 --> 07:35.955
[Fujita whimpers, screams]

07:36.038 --> 07:36.998
[thud]

07:39.208 --> 07:40.751
[Noi] Fujita? Fujita!

07:40.835 --> 07:42.753
- Are you okay?
- [gasps weakly]

07:42.837 --> 07:44.464
[Noi] Sorry about that.

07:44.547 --> 07:47.049
I was so into my training
that I didn't notice you.

07:47.133 --> 07:48.176
[Fujita groans]

07:48.259 --> 07:50.678
Hey, wait... Where's Ebisu?

07:50.761 --> 07:53.473
[screaming]

07:53.556 --> 07:54.682
Did you kill her?

07:54.765 --> 07:56.517
I didn't! I didn't! [sobs]

07:56.601 --> 07:58.686
- You want me to heal her, right?
- Huh?

07:58.769 --> 08:00.188
[Noi blowing]

08:03.399 --> 08:05.693
[Fujita] Hey! Wait. Wait a minute.

08:05.776 --> 08:09.197
You just healed her while
the devil's hairpin was inside her head!

08:09.280 --> 08:10.656
[Noi chuckling] Really?

08:10.740 --> 08:14.202
Well, if there's anything wrong with her
when she wakes up, just bring her back.

08:15.036 --> 08:18.706
You sure she'll be all right?
At least the rotting smell is gone.

08:19.415 --> 08:22.335
That's more like it, Ebisu.
All cleaned up!

08:23.461 --> 08:25.087
[straining] So heavy...

08:25.171 --> 08:28.174
I can't do this much longer. Oh?

08:29.175 --> 08:30.593
There you are, Kikurage!

08:32.428 --> 08:33.638
PUNCH!

08:34.430 --> 08:36.390
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN?

08:36.474 --> 08:37.600
[Kikurage blowing]

08:37.934 --> 08:39.644
LET'S PLAY SOME MORE.

08:41.437 --> 08:43.773
PUNCH!

08:44.815 --> 08:46.609
HUH? DID YOU DIE AGAIN...

08:46.943 --> 08:48.945
THIS WILL MAKE YOU FEEL BETTER.

08:49.028 --> 08:50.363
[giggles]

08:50.446 --> 08:51.364
ANOTHER PUNCH...

08:51.447 --> 08:52.406
[Fujita] Stop it!

08:52.490 --> 08:53.407
EEK! YOU AGAIN?

08:53.491 --> 08:55.743
Don't waste your powers on a stupid bug!

08:55.826 --> 08:56.994
WHAT ARE YOU DOING? STOP IT!

08:57.078 --> 08:59.330
[Fujita] Look, it's a corpse.
Bring it back to life!

08:59.413 --> 09:00.831
I'M SCARED!

09:00.915 --> 09:02.250
[Fujita] Come on!

09:02.333 --> 09:03.668
[electronic whirring]

09:05.545 --> 09:08.631
- [pained gasp]
- [Kikurage screaming]

09:08.714 --> 09:12.468
I guess that was the terrible thing...

09:13.052 --> 09:13.928
EBISU

09:14.011 --> 09:15.721
[pleasant music playing]

09:15.805 --> 09:17.098
[Fujita] Oh well.

09:17.181 --> 09:20.977
In the end,
I wasn't able to revive Ebisu today.

09:21.852 --> 09:24.021
I'll try again tomorrow.

09:25.565 --> 09:26.857
[door squeaking]

09:29.569 --> 09:31.779
HEY, LADY, ARE YOU SLEEPING?

09:33.072 --> 09:35.575
WE HAVE A DEAL. YOU ALWAYS
GIVE ME A SNACK AT THIS TIME.

09:35.825 --> 09:39.620
WAKE UP, LADY! IT'S TIME FOR MY SNACK!

09:41.330 --> 09:42.582
[Ebisu groans softly]

09:46.168 --> 09:47.878
NOW, GIVE ME A SNACK.

09:47.962 --> 09:49.171
[music fades]

09:51.173 --> 09:54.218
- [bleak music playing]
- [distant screams]

09:55.094 --> 09:57.096
[En gasps] Just what the hell...

09:57.179 --> 09:58.889
[unsettling warbling]

09:58.973 --> 10:00.850
- ...are you?
- [high-pitched ringing]

10:00.933 --> 10:02.476
[gasping]

10:02.560 --> 10:04.687
- [panting]
- [clock dinging]

10:07.398 --> 10:10.192
I'm having that dream again. Damn it.

10:10.693 --> 10:12.778
Could it be that I'm scared of something?

10:13.946 --> 10:16.782
Is the Cross-Eyes' boss
still alive somehow?

10:17.283 --> 10:19.994
If only I could just use Nikaido's Magic...

10:20.620 --> 10:22.371
[Chota humming merrily]

10:22.455 --> 10:24.373
Gotta stay hydrated.

10:24.874 --> 10:27.251
- Oh, Ebisu. [gasps]
- [Ebisu] Uh...

10:27.335 --> 10:31.088
[Chota] I heard you got a new mask.
It looks good on you.

10:31.172 --> 10:33.549
Not that I can really
see you though. [giggles]

10:34.675 --> 10:35.885
[Ebisu snickers, laughs]

10:35.968 --> 10:39.013
[Chota] Uh, looks like the hairpin
I gave her is still inside her head,

10:39.096 --> 10:41.349
and it's made her even crazier than ever...

10:41.432 --> 10:42.725
[Ebisu] You're so funny!

10:42.808 --> 10:45.144
[giggling hysterically]

10:45.227 --> 10:46.520
[Chota sighs happily]

10:46.604 --> 10:48.356
Ever since I became a mushroom,

10:48.439 --> 10:52.068
I feel more at ease
in dark forests like this. [giggles]

10:52.151 --> 10:55.446
[radio host] Now, let's see the horoscope
for Gemini Sorcerers this month.

10:55.529 --> 10:56.781
Hey! I'm a Gemini!

10:56.864 --> 10:58.532
Outlook is so-so.

10:58.616 --> 11:01.118
There will be something
that makes you even more fond

11:01.202 --> 11:03.788
of the person you've been having
one-sided feelings toward.

11:03.871 --> 11:05.790
[chuckles] I'm looking forward to that.

11:05.873 --> 11:10.294
- Next, the horoscope for Capricorns.
- But "so-so", huh? Oh, that's En.

11:10.378 --> 11:11.671
Very bad.

11:11.754 --> 11:14.507
However, some of the problems
you've left in the past

11:14.590 --> 11:16.050
will reach some kind of conclusion.

11:16.133 --> 11:18.177
She said it's "bad." Poor En!

11:18.260 --> 11:19.679
Let's see the horoscope...

11:19.762 --> 11:22.139
- But I'm a little worried.
- Good.

11:22.223 --> 11:25.685
Her fortune-telling is usually spot on.

11:26.477 --> 11:27.645
[man] Good work.

11:27.728 --> 11:30.189
- Would you like some juice?
- [Dokuga] Yes, please.

11:30.272 --> 11:31.649
TERMITE EXTERMINATION

11:31.732 --> 11:33.150
[Dokuga] I'm so tired.

11:33.776 --> 11:35.736
It might not cost anything,

11:36.362 --> 11:39.198
but killing termites with spit
is hard work.

11:39.281 --> 11:41.075
[spitting]

11:41.158 --> 11:43.703
[Dokuga] Tetsujo and Ton's medical bills
won't pay themselves.

11:43.786 --> 11:46.622
[Natsuki] Hey, big bro!
Dokuga, hey, wait up!

11:47.123 --> 11:48.457
Oh, you've got some juice!

11:48.541 --> 11:50.710
- Give me a sip---
- Stop it. You'll die.

11:50.793 --> 11:53.379
So, how much did you make today?

11:53.462 --> 11:55.589
Six hundred nicks from three houses.

11:55.673 --> 11:58.426
[Natsuki] I made 800 nicks as a waitress.

11:59.009 --> 12:00.720
[Dokuga] Oh, I see...

12:00.803 --> 12:02.221
[uneasy music playing]

12:03.180 --> 12:04.223
[Saji] Dokuga.

12:04.306 --> 12:06.642
I talked it over with Ushijimada,

12:06.726 --> 12:09.770
and I think we've got no choice
but to pawn this.

12:09.854 --> 12:14.233
[Ushishimada] We both looked for work
all day. This is all we made! [groaning]

12:14.316 --> 12:16.902
There aren't any decent jobs
for people like us.

12:16.986 --> 12:19.113
You have to be a Magic user
for everything!

12:19.196 --> 12:20.698
It's as he says.

12:20.781 --> 12:22.742
In order to save Tetsujo and Ton,

12:22.825 --> 12:26.245
we need to get our hands on
some grade-A smoke as soon as possible.

12:28.330 --> 12:30.624
This is the only thing we can't pawn.

12:30.708 --> 12:32.710
You what? But why not?

12:32.793 --> 12:36.213
Are you willing to let Tetsujo and Ton die
over some damn knife?

12:36.297 --> 12:39.258
If I find out you've been hiding
something from us I'll-- Oof!

12:39.341 --> 12:40.634
[Dokuga grunts]

12:40.718 --> 12:41.844
- Hey!
- Listen.

12:41.927 --> 12:45.473
These knives are something
that were entrusted to me by the boss.

12:45.556 --> 12:47.475
I'll return it to him myself.

12:48.392 --> 12:51.479
I'll also get back
everything we've pawned so far.

12:51.562 --> 12:53.856
And I'll do something about the money.

12:53.939 --> 12:56.484
If you understand, keep your mouth shut.

12:56.567 --> 12:58.486
Yes, I get it.

12:58.569 --> 13:00.112
So if you could just...

13:00.196 --> 13:01.530
[coughing]

13:01.614 --> 13:02.865
[Saji] Hey, Dokuga!

13:03.657 --> 13:05.367
[Ushishimada gasps, coughs]

13:05.451 --> 13:08.370
CROSS-EYE EXPEDITION

13:10.498 --> 13:11.665
[Dokuga] Shaitan.

13:11.749 --> 13:16.128
An organization for the few existing
heal and repair-type Sorcerers.

13:17.463 --> 13:21.133
They're the ones driving up the price
of repair-type smoke.

13:22.134 --> 13:24.637
With tight security, and plenty of guards,

13:24.720 --> 13:26.972
it's a hard place to break into.

13:27.056 --> 13:28.224
However...

13:28.307 --> 13:29.308
[women giggling]

13:29.391 --> 13:32.144
...every day,
they call in women and have parties.

13:32.728 --> 13:34.647
[guard] All right, let's have fun tonight!

13:34.730 --> 13:36.649
[women squealing, whooping]

13:36.732 --> 13:38.150
[laughter]

13:38.234 --> 13:41.654
[guard] The booze is great.
Drink up, drink up!

13:41.737 --> 13:44.615
[guard 2] There's a lot more
in that jar too.

13:44.698 --> 13:45.908
[upbeat music playing]

13:45.991 --> 13:49.245
They're throwing another party downstairs.

13:49.328 --> 13:51.914
We should get to have some fun
once in a while.

13:53.374 --> 13:55.376
[guard 3] Would you like some fruit?

13:57.920 --> 13:58.879
[Dokuga chuckles]

14:05.177 --> 14:06.303
[punch sizzling]

14:10.391 --> 14:11.684
[music fades]

14:11.767 --> 14:13.686
[static buzzing]

14:13.769 --> 14:14.895
[tense music playing]

14:14.979 --> 14:17.273
[Dokuga] Every time
a Cross-Eyes is revealed,

14:17.356 --> 14:20.192
it's only matter of time
before En eliminates them.

14:20.985 --> 14:24.113
So we've been quietly waiting
for the boss to return.

14:24.655 --> 14:26.866
- But we can't wait anymore.
- Die, you little-

14:27.700 --> 14:29.118
[pained groan]

14:31.287 --> 14:33.247
[Dokuga] A murder without Magic.

14:34.415 --> 14:37.376
En is definitely going to hear about this.

14:37.459 --> 14:38.836
[bag zipper closing]

14:40.296 --> 14:43.173
[Dokuga] Boss, where are you?

14:47.219 --> 14:48.178
[moaning weakly]

14:48.262 --> 14:49.722
Where am I?

14:50.431 --> 14:51.599
[weak groan]

14:51.682 --> 14:52.933
It's you.

14:53.726 --> 14:54.935
Who are you?

14:55.728 --> 14:58.564
The name's Aikawa. Nice to meet you.

14:59.064 --> 15:00.941
BIG BANDAGE MASK
SAFE AND SECURE

15:01.025 --> 15:04.695
[Aikawa] Good thing I bought
a full-sized bandage mask.

15:06.280 --> 15:08.365
All right, I'm doing it.

15:17.625 --> 15:20.419
Thank you.
It doesn't sting as much anymore.

15:20.502 --> 15:24.423
[Aikawa] What's your name?
And why the hell do you look like that?

15:24.506 --> 15:26.258
My name's Asu...

15:26.342 --> 15:28.427
No, I'm Kawajiri.

15:29.011 --> 15:30.512
Don't you remember?

15:30.596 --> 15:33.849
The devil from the basement
of the church in En's mansion.

15:34.975 --> 15:36.894
[Aikawa] What are you talking about?

15:36.977 --> 15:40.147
[Kawajiri] Wait.
Aren't you the man named Caiman?

15:40.230 --> 15:43.317
You were Nikaido's friend
from back in Hole?

15:43.400 --> 15:46.946
[Aikawa] Nikaido?
I don't know anyone with that name.

15:48.030 --> 15:50.991
It seems I have you mixed up
with someone else.

15:51.492 --> 15:54.954
Anyway, thanks for your help.
I'll be going now.

15:56.372 --> 15:58.123
[Aikawa] Going? Hey, wait!

16:00.084 --> 16:01.669
[unsettling music playing]

16:04.296 --> 16:06.256
Time to work, you two.

16:07.091 --> 16:09.802
[Shin] Is it true
the Cross-Eyes are on the move again?

16:09.885 --> 16:10.970
[En] Yeah.

16:11.053 --> 16:15.599
There's a shop in Devas called Shaitan.
Every Sorcerer inside was slaughtered.

16:16.100 --> 16:18.894
The footprints suggest
there's only one culprit,

16:18.978 --> 16:20.604
and they used a blade.

16:21.105 --> 16:24.733
It might be the work
of the Cross-Eyes' boss.

16:24.817 --> 16:26.360
Make sure you finish him!

16:27.820 --> 16:29.488
- [Shin grunts]
- [Noi grunts]

16:29.571 --> 16:33.993
Well, once again, our work requires us
to part ways, Kasukabe.

16:34.076 --> 16:36.662
- [engine starts]
- [Noi] Be a good boy while we're gone.

16:36.745 --> 16:39.415
[Kasukabe] Hey, Shin,
I've always wanted to meet a devil.

16:39.498 --> 16:41.000
Do you know how I can do that?

16:41.083 --> 16:43.919
I heard here's a room
somewhere in the mansion

16:44.003 --> 16:45.629
built to summon devils.

16:45.713 --> 16:47.256
Don't do anything stupid!

16:47.339 --> 16:51.010
- [Kasukabe] Got it. I'll look for it.
- [Jonson chittering]

16:53.470 --> 16:55.973
[En] What am I so anxious about?

16:56.515 --> 16:58.350
To think I'd send Shin and Noi

16:58.434 --> 17:01.478
before I was even sure
it was the Cross-Eyes...

17:02.896 --> 17:06.275
- Why? Why this sense of uneasiness?
- [door opens]

17:06.358 --> 17:08.652
Hey, En. Let's have some tea!

17:09.778 --> 17:10.988
[En] Tea, huh?

17:13.240 --> 17:16.660
En, what are you planning
to do with Nikaido?

17:16.744 --> 17:19.621
She's gonna die
unless you do something for her soon.

17:20.289 --> 17:24.668
For reasons I can't understand,
Nikaido refuses to use her Magic.

17:25.461 --> 17:29.173
I've tried to respect her will
and watch over her,

17:29.923 --> 17:31.175
but I'm at my limit.

17:32.551 --> 17:37.056
I'm going to make her use her Magic.
Even if I have to get rough.

17:37.765 --> 17:41.226
Is the Cross-Eyes' boss
really dead or not?

17:41.310 --> 17:43.437
That's what I must confirm!

17:43.520 --> 17:47.107
Six years ago,
I used all my Magic to subdue him,

17:47.191 --> 17:48.317
and then...

17:48.400 --> 17:50.986
[Chota] The town of Mastema was destroyed.

17:51.487 --> 17:55.824
Nobody could have gotten out of there
without turning into a mushroom man.

17:55.908 --> 17:58.619
[En] Even so, I know what I saw!

17:59.119 --> 18:03.832
The shadow of a headless man
crawling out of the mushrooms!

18:07.503 --> 18:08.921
[Aikawa gasping]

18:09.630 --> 18:11.840
- Where are we?
- [Kawajiri] En's mansion.

18:11.924 --> 18:14.551
So it was your Magic that got us here?

18:15.719 --> 18:18.555
[Kawajiri] Nikaido is up ahead. Let's go.

18:18.639 --> 18:20.057
[footsteps fading]

18:20.140 --> 18:21.266
Damn it.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.851
[suspenseful music playing]

18:22.935 --> 18:26.605
[Aikawa] So tell me,
are you a big-shot Sorcerer or something?

18:27.106 --> 18:30.109
Must be nice to be able to go
anywhere you want.

18:30.609 --> 18:32.820
[Kawajiri] What kind of Magic do you use?

18:34.113 --> 18:38.408
[Aikawa] Well, you know...
I can't just tell someone I've barely met.

18:38.909 --> 18:39.827
[door opens]

18:39.910 --> 18:40.994
[Kawajiri] Nikaido.

18:41.620 --> 18:42.830
[Nikaido] Huh?

18:42.913 --> 18:46.667
- Who are you?
- [gasps] Nikaido! It's me, Asu.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.210
[strained grunt] Asu?

18:48.293 --> 18:52.881
Chidaruma turned me back into a Sorcerer,
and now I look like this.

18:53.465 --> 18:56.135
So that's what happened to you, Asu.

18:56.635 --> 18:59.930
I hope Chidaruma didn't do this
because you helped me.

19:00.013 --> 19:03.684
It's okay. After all,
I did owe you one for saving me.

19:04.184 --> 19:06.395
You're in rough shape here, huh?

19:07.312 --> 19:09.648
[Nikaido] It's because I'm rejecting
the contract with En.

19:10.232 --> 19:12.025
I'm managing to hold on,

19:13.235 --> 19:16.405
but still, I think I'm at my limit.

19:16.989 --> 19:20.409
You wanna get out of here?
With my Magic, that's no problem.

19:20.492 --> 19:21.368
[Nikaido] Huh?

19:21.910 --> 19:23.912
- Who is he?
- [Kawajiri] Oh...

19:23.996 --> 19:26.999
- That guy is...
- Hey, I'm Aikawa.

19:27.082 --> 19:30.377
I have nothing to do with this,
but he brought me here.

19:30.878 --> 19:32.045
I know that voice...

19:32.129 --> 19:35.799
I'm sorry, but could you take off
that mask and show me your face?

19:35.883 --> 19:38.051
Huh? What for?

19:38.135 --> 19:41.305
How come you can't take it off?
It's not a big deal, right?

19:41.388 --> 19:42.764
[Kawajiri] Nikaido?

19:42.848 --> 19:45.642
[Aikawa] You know what?
I'm gonna get out of here.

19:45.726 --> 19:46.852
Caiman!

19:50.355 --> 19:52.191
[Aikawa] I don't know who that is.

19:52.691 --> 19:55.235
- I'll make you take off that mask!
- [Kawajiri] Oh!

19:55.861 --> 19:57.154
[Aikawa] Oof!

19:57.905 --> 19:59.198
[Nikaido grunts]

19:59.281 --> 20:00.949
[dramatic music playing]

20:01.033 --> 20:02.701
[Aikawa] Stop it!

20:02.784 --> 20:03.744
[both grunting]

20:05.078 --> 20:07.206
- [Nikaido breathing heavily]
- [Aikawa] Huh?

20:07.289 --> 20:09.708
- See? You should knock this off--
- [grunts]

20:09.791 --> 20:10.959
[groans] Oh no.

20:13.587 --> 20:15.047
- Gotcha!
- [Aikawa grunts]

20:15.130 --> 20:16.548
[Nikaido gasps]

20:16.632 --> 20:18.050
Ni... Nikaido!

20:18.759 --> 20:21.762
[Aikawa and Nikaido grunt, groan]

20:21.845 --> 20:23.555
[labored breathing]

20:23.639 --> 20:25.057
[sobbing]

20:25.140 --> 20:26.683
Caiman... [sniffles]

20:27.643 --> 20:29.561
[Nikaido continues sobbing]

20:30.604 --> 20:31.855
[mask clunking]

20:31.939 --> 20:33.649
[Aikawa sighs] Are you happy now?

20:33.732 --> 20:34.775
[gasps]

20:35.984 --> 20:37.069
Oh man.

20:37.152 --> 20:39.321
You're one violent girl, aren't you?

20:40.072 --> 20:41.615
Cai...man?

20:42.449 --> 20:43.325
[gasps]

20:46.995 --> 20:48.372
[Aikawa] See you later.

20:48.455 --> 20:50.624
- [suspenseful music playing]
- [Nikaido] Huh?

20:53.585 --> 20:54.544
[Aikawa grunts]

21:02.719 --> 21:03.929
Nikaido?

21:04.554 --> 21:07.432
Was that man really Caiman after all?

21:08.058 --> 21:09.184
I don't know.

21:10.185 --> 21:11.895
[Kawajiri] Should we go after him?

21:12.521 --> 21:13.522
Yeah.

21:18.652 --> 21:20.821
Nikaido! Nikai...

21:21.446 --> 21:22.489
[gasps]

21:22.572 --> 21:24.449
Oh no, the drip-feed!

21:24.533 --> 21:25.951
Nikaido!

21:27.035 --> 21:28.412
[pained groaning]

21:28.912 --> 21:31.415
I'm getting headaches again.

21:31.915 --> 21:34.543
- [birds cawing ominously]
- [uneasy music playing]

21:35.919 --> 21:37.337
[Curse] Huh?

21:37.963 --> 21:39.840
I found him.

21:39.923 --> 21:42.342
[Ebisu giggling]

21:43.051 --> 21:46.346
You've been laughing
ever since you came back to life.

21:47.389 --> 21:50.559
You better not laugh
when we go to Mr. En's place.

21:51.059 --> 21:53.812
We're gonna ask him
to let you stay at the mansion.

21:53.895 --> 21:55.355
You gotta shape up!

21:55.439 --> 21:58.358
From here on out, you're all on your own.

21:58.442 --> 21:59.484
Do you understand?

22:00.319 --> 22:01.361
Uh... [gasps]

22:01.445 --> 22:02.487
[silence]

22:05.532 --> 22:07.701
[giggling]

22:08.327 --> 22:10.370
[laughing loudly]

22:10.454 --> 22:11.455
You idiot!

22:12.456 --> 22:14.374
[unsettling warbling]

22:14.958 --> 22:16.376
- [Ebisu] Oh...
- What the...?

22:16.460 --> 22:19.171
- Whoa! [gasping]
- [Ebisu yells unsteadily]

22:19.254 --> 22:20.297
[Fujita grunts]

22:20.380 --> 22:24.009
What is this? I feel sick. It's like...

22:24.092 --> 22:24.926
[gasps]

22:25.010 --> 22:26.720
[tense music playing]

22:29.014 --> 22:30.307
- [Ebisu retching]
- [whimpering]

22:33.352 --> 22:36.063
[En] I'm making Nikaido
use her Magic today!

22:36.146 --> 22:38.315
I can't hold back anymore. Hmm?

22:38.398 --> 22:40.067
- [Kikurage whimpering]
- [En] Kikurage.

22:40.150 --> 22:41.234
Come here.

22:42.235 --> 22:43.070
Kikurage?

22:44.071 --> 22:47.074
The security device... And she's terrified.

22:48.909 --> 22:50.535
- [grunts]
- [Chota] What's happening?

22:50.619 --> 22:51.828
Suddenly I feel sick.

22:51.912 --> 22:53.830
DEFORMED REUNION

22:55.415 --> 22:57.250
[ominous music building]

23:02.923 --> 23:04.341
[En gasps]

23:06.176 --> 23:07.469
You...

23:13.558 --> 23:14.976
I knew it.

23:16.061 --> 23:17.729
You were alive!

23:17.813 --> 23:19.815
[blowing slowly]

23:20.315 --> 23:22.359
- [En gasps]
- [Chota] Huh?!

23:22.442 --> 23:24.736
Take care of Kikurage. Go now!

23:24.820 --> 23:26.279
[Chota] En? En!

23:26.363 --> 23:29.366
[wailing gasp, screaming]

23:30.075 --> 23:34.538
En!

23:41.211 --> 23:43.338
[En] It's just like six years ago.

23:43.422 --> 23:46.425
I'm getting dizzy.
My body is throbbing in pain.

23:46.508 --> 23:48.802
This will be over in an instant.

23:48.885 --> 23:51.138
[grunts softly, gasps]

23:53.473 --> 23:54.474
[groans]

23:55.183 --> 23:56.017
[gasps]

23:57.853 --> 23:59.229
[gasps]

23:59.312 --> 24:00.814
[tense music building]

24:02.983 --> 24:05.402
[En] I'll end this with my own hands.

24:07.070 --> 24:08.029
[music ends]

24:11.575 --> 24:12.742
[groans loudly]

24:13.827 --> 24:16.872
Blow smoke out now! En!

24:16.955 --> 24:18.623
[retching]

24:18.707 --> 24:20.000
[mournful music playing]

24:20.667 --> 24:22.043
[labored breathing]

24:35.015 --> 24:36.349
[Chota] En!

24:36.433 --> 24:39.144
How long is this mushroom gonna fly?

24:39.936 --> 24:41.855
Huh? I'm back to normal?

24:42.481 --> 24:44.149
Huh? Why?

24:44.691 --> 24:45.692
[gasps]

24:46.902 --> 24:50.363
No. No way... It can't be...

24:50.447 --> 24:51.740
En!

24:51.823 --> 24:54.367
[sobbing]

24:54.451 --> 24:56.036
[Fujita panting]

24:56.119 --> 24:58.914
A headless man, it's gotta be...

24:58.997 --> 25:01.458
[panting]

25:01.958 --> 25:02.834
[gasps]

25:03.919 --> 25:04.878
[whimpers]

25:04.961 --> 25:06.463
[unsettling music building]

25:10.967 --> 25:11.927
[music fades]

25:12.969 --> 25:14.804
[Japanese theme song playing]

26:41.641 --> 26:42.934
THE END

26:43.018 --> 26:45.103
[narrator] What we learned in Episode 19.

26:45.186 --> 26:47.147
Fujita's love for Ebisu is real.

26:47.230 --> 26:48.940
Chota's ever-changing head.

26:49.024 --> 26:50.775
The boss's overwhelming strength.

26:50.859 --> 26:52.152
En!

26:52.235 --> 26:56.072
What we're going to learn in Episode 20,
it's still lost in chaos.

26:56.156 --> 26:57.949
This is Dorohedoro!
